      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": ">Due to this phenomenon, the creator misunderstood that \"the work was stolen!\", causing trouble. Immediate fix required.\nThe creator of a world is indicated on the detailed world screen.\nEven if someone other than the creator opens a new instance and uses the world, the creator of the world remains the same and only that person.\nIt is unlikely to be misunderstood.",
