      "mergeID": "6462b58dd562c709459dcfc1",
      "mergedPostDetails": "1. Create a world and uplaod it as private.\n\n2. Go to the webpage of the world. (https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_6e0dcd13-9827-4cc4-aa04-1ca43e9f1485)\n\n3. Click create instance, the type of instance doesn't matter. You will then be directed to the webpage for the specific instance. Don't enter the instance yet. (https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_6e0dcd13-9827-4cc4-aa04-1ca43e9f1485&instanceId=55717~hidden(usr_2c4e17a6-2990-49da-9f50-3c6c1efa90ed)~region(us)~nonce(162a5594-b17e-45a9-ac0b-f4fd985e03e8))\n\n4. Now edit the URL of the webpage, removing the \"~hidden\"/\"~private\" and \"~nonce\" sections. Optionally, change the \"instanceId=\" to something witty like \"BugReportTest\". (https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_6e0dcd13-9827-4cc4-aa04-1ca43e9f1485&instanceId=BugReportTest~region(us))\n\n5. Click \"Launch World\" or \"Invite Me\". You are now in a public instance of a private world. Kinda.\n\nThe world is not publicly listed, so the instance is not truly public. Only people with friends in the world/instance should be able to find it via \"Social -> Friend Locations\". The world creator can also see it existing, even if you aren't friends with them.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Public Instance (kinda) of Private World",
      "parentID": "6457f677d44a0d0997defd5c",
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "634b5912eb602b451d40008a",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6075605abff0176ab3cf79ee|full_name}: Why would I mention a personal issue in a bug report? No need to bring the drama in here. Please stay civilized and constructive. Your comment doesn't add to the report, aside from saying that it is an old issue, that hasn't been fixed.\n\nYour warning to me was given to me after I made the second instance (ID: NotBanned), which was named that because I wanted to let you know that your UdonScript was broken. And the third instance (ID: WhatNow) was supposed to be a Friends+ instance, but I guess I screwed something up when editing the URL, which then might mean my other bug report was made in error. Do you wanna try to reproduce that other bug report with me to make sure?\n\nI made the bug report when I felt there was a reason to. Namely you starting to accuse me of hacking and whatever else. The only thing I have ever done against you EVER, is hangout in instances of your world while we have friends in common there, and making these public instances as a little protest against your weird decisions. Now this is the most we have communicated in like two years. You are free to ignore me again now, instead of actively seeking me out to kick me. Anyway, this discussion is better taken elsewhere, if it even has to continue.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
