      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't see how my bug report was a duplicate of this bug report. Or are we not supposed to be able to make new instances of someone else's private world at all?\n\nInteresting nonetheless. Would love to hear what the intended behavior is.\n\nIf we compare \"private avatar\" to \"private world\", they definitely seem to behave differently. Worlds were referred to as \"unlisted\" before, which seems to describe the current behavior better.\n\nPersonally I would love to see different levels of world privacy. Could have \"private world\" be literally for only the creator, and \"unlisted world\" as the current behavior.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
