      "value": "@{6142bc91c830f70736b61114|full_name}: \"public\" instances of a private world aren't a bug anyway if you have to get to them through manipulating strings. Yeah, of course it'll work that way. But the part where you can create an instance at all is valid, and locking that down is a reasonable feature request, and so has been merged with other posts related to that.",
