  "details": "VRChat Version:2022.3.1\nDescription of the bug:\nI am Japanese. This article uses Google Translate.\nThird parties can now create worlds that have been made private by the creator.\nThis is a bug that makes it look like the author's work was easily stolen and should be fixed immediately.\nmeaning\n1: When the creator creates an instance, the private world can be seen from that location\n2: Third parties can set up new instances from that screen\nSimilarly, I was able to confirm that I could create an instance from the website.\nDue to this phenomenon, the creator misunderstood that \"the work was stolen!\", causing trouble. Immediate fix required.\n↓The world in this screenshot is a private world created by a friend named Mireha.\nAs a result of this procedure, Aoneko (me) can create an instance.",
